      "text": "TO: THE MAYOR\n\nFROM: THE CORPORATION COUNSEL\n\nRE: EFFECT OF GARDNER v. BRODERICK and UNIFORMED SANITATIONMEN ASSN. INC. v. COMM'R ON DISCIPLINARY PROCEEDINGS",
